                          <android.widget.TextView index="1" package="com.cyberlink.powerdirector.DRA140225_01" class="android.widget.TextView" text="【Nobody Wants to Go】&#10;Green Tech announces its beach cleanup, and Mia registers alone after Lily declines to join her.&#10;&#10;【The Last Person She Expected】&#10;Mia arrives alone at the shore and meets Ethan when he catches her windblown cleanup bag.&#10;&#10;【A Surprisingly Good Team】&#10;Mia and Ethan collect shoreline litter together and find an effortless working rhythm.&#10;&#10;【More in Common】&#10;Taking a break by the seawall, Mia and Ethan acknowledge their matching habits and growing attraction.&#10;&#10;【After the Cleanup】&#10;Lingering by the collection truck covered in sand, Ethan steps close to Mia and she welcomes his attention.&#10;&#10;【Glad We Came】&#10;Back at the Green Tech office months later, Ethan and Mia clasp hands over her desk wearing matching silver rings.&#10;&#10;Possible Characters:&#10;• Mia Carter — white American Green Tech brand-marketing employee with light brown hair and distinctly Western facial features; sincere and committed to sustainability.&#10;• Ethan Bennett — white American product engineer with brown hair and distinctly Western facial features; thoughtful and quietly environmentally conscious.&#10;• Lily Morgan — white American coworker with blonde hair and distinctly Western facial features; friendly but reluctant to spend a day outside." resource-id="com.cyberlink.powerdirector.DRA140225_01:id/text_mini_drama_outline_card_body" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" scrollable="false" selected="false" bounds="[90,88][990,1017]" displayed="true" a11y-important="true" screen-reader-focusable="false" drawing-order="2" showing-hint="false" text-entry-key="false" dismissable="false" a11y-focused="false" heading="false" live-region="0" context-clickable="false" content-inv